[{"title":"相见欢 其一 春晓","author":"曹尔堪","text":"早春数遍庭梅，雪中开。\n果是深深院宇，印莓苔。\n无个事，牵愁思，尽悠哉。\n百舌惊人不管，枕边催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36032,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"相见欢 其二 江村","author":"曹尔堪","text":"水痕新涨苔矶，杏花飞。\n江岸蒲芽如箭，鲚鱼肥。\n蝇头利，争无已，昨元非。\n只有子归明白，唤人归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36033,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子 其一 和澹心","author":"曹尔堪","text":"花开别后枝，草满来时路。\n白藕五更风，红豆三更雨。\n歌喉月互沉，舞影云同去。\n留只为人留，住肯随君住。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36034,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子 其二 别思","author":"曹尔堪","text":"柳枝离别多，杜牧风流在。\n薄幸不成怜，休挽荷花戴。\n灯前印口脂，镜里留眉黛。\n愁绪问如何，雨滴蕉心碎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36035,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"昭君怨 巳卯二月同斯羽兄弟招集舟中观演家剧，魏子一于雨中为余图扇，因调小词题其上","author":"曹尔堪","text":"日暮画船微雨，图取春阴缕缕。\n烟气散江湄，柳痕垂。\n一笔远村如抹，望去胭脂欲泼。\n屋角有桃花，是谁家？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36036,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"女冠子  其一 秋日述怀","author":"曹尔堪","text":"淡烟浓水，正值江南秋美。\n力田嘉，小巷晴收秫，山厨晚煮瓜。\n鹅黄家酝酒，猩赤手栽花。\n一雨重阳近，觉寒些。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36037,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"女冠子 其二 山房寒思","author":"曹尔堪","text":"吴船来往，爱听画眉停桨。\n冷红飞，石丑犹称丈，花娇却字妃。\n伫看千药绽，空忆四腮肥。\n松鼠檐前落，已忘机。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36038,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其一 丙子夏日村墅","author":"曹尔堪","text":"长昼方炎，画梁归喘寻泥燕。\n桔槔声断，露稻幽香遍。\n倚树当风，欲比闲云倦。\n苹花院，小池波浅。\n绿上窗纱半。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36039,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其二 江村","author":"曹尔堪","text":"苦是春阴，桃花半落江村暮。\n垂杨千树，缥缈渔船渡。\n青满田畴，难认牛羊路。\n溪边步，野鸥飞去，只爱无人处。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36040,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其三 感旧","author":"曹尔堪","text":"记得黄昏，眉梢微见红潮印。\n夜深低问，酿作分离恨。\n翻悔当初，合了鸳鸯枕。\n嗟孤另，欲通佳讯，人远天涯近。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36041,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其四 遣夏东除庵","author":"曹尔堪","text":"莲褪红衣，回塘雨盖藏鸂鶒。\n柳丝嫌直，故倩莺来织。\n蒲戟青稠，点缀清溪色。\n方池黑，细鱼吞墨，道士鹅难得。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36042,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其五 沛上怀古","author":"曹尔堪","text":"禾黍风清，乱山高下供凭吊。\n龙吟虎啸，绛灌由屠豹。\n转眼兴亡，陵阙余残烧，谁能料，汉家遗庙，明月依然照。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36043,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其六 陆舫春思","author":"曹尔堪","text":"沙暖蒲香，凤池涨绿晴波皱。\n搓黄御柳，三月春方透。\n小径闲吟，碧鲜生鸳甃。\n消晴昼，雨丝拖逗，似补梨花瘦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36044,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其七 秋暮旅怀柬翼苍","author":"曹尔堪","text":"衰草重冈，雁灯吹灭诸陵火。\n谁家菊朵，开近扶风左。\n无限悲秋，难觅江淮舵。\n耽枯坐，闲门深锁，红叶堆中我。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36045,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其八 旅晓柬汉思","author":"曹尔堪","text":"幔卷同云，平皋木介霜威肃。\n柳条吹秃，犹映晴淮绿。\n道德微言，为目宁为腹，堪三复，他年空谷，活火煨黄独。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36046,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙  晓起","author":"曹尔堪","text":"乐事贫家竟不贪，疏雨斜风过城南。\n单纱消受嫩凉甘。\n宿砚频催童子涤，好花颁与侍儿簪。\n暗将私语赌宜男。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36047,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其一 秋日园居二调","author":"曹尔堪","text":"谢客微躯不愿劳，病余觉减酒狂豪。\n花间行碍◇◇高。\n个个蔓牵黄荔子，垂垂架挂紫蒲萄。\n晓盛芳露和兰膏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36048,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其二 秋日园居二调","author":"曹尔堪","text":"消夏如忘伏日高，藤床一枕暑能逃。\n起呼童子候茶涛。\n书有蠹巢思曝卷，笺遣蝇墨阻挥毫。\n编来团扇鹤遗毛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36049,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其一 春","author":"曹尔堪","text":"荔子红绫窄称身，轻笼淡墨舞衫新。\n回眸检点著芳尘。\n黄雀夜飞归玉辇，紫骝日暖闹朱轮。\n青楼梳掠惹游人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36050,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其二 夏","author":"曹尔堪","text":"八尺须龙一尺绡，初离凉枕印红潮。\n自然香腻洗难消。\n玳瑁帘垂留紫燕，珊瑚架倒戏金猫。\n藕丝香里送鸾箫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36051,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其三 秋","author":"曹尔堪","text":"玉盌低斟酒力微，风前团扇未停挥。\n砧敲红泪落征衣。\n愁见月高褰绣箔，起乘人静弄金徽，鸳鸯幔冷一萤飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36052,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其四 冬","author":"曹尔堪","text":"翠被难温夜似年，珠帘轻卷雾如烟。\n寒鸦啼到画梁边。\n鹦鹉怯风攒绿羽，金猊贮火熨红毡。\n秦筝冻断十三弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36053,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其五 过灵塔庵","author":"曹尔堪","text":"棘刺杉针墓外田，鸭头匀绿泻堂前。\n山僧拥衲只高眠。\n粉堞影深垂柳畔，石桥路仄野凫边。\n斜阳踏破草芊芊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36054,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其六 出郭","author":"曹尔堪","text":"绿遍汀蒲浅浪交，波摇新柳散晴郊。\n幽人携屐叩蓬茅。\n蛙骇早雷开蛰户，鹊占太岁启春巢。\n归来斜日过花梢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36055,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其七 闺情","author":"曹尔堪","text":"朱槛移灯拾翠钿，碧纱窗里簟纹圆，薄寒微觉枕痕边。\n鸂鶒帐开调凤髓，鹧鸪曲就拨鹍弦，银筝撩我不曾眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36056,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其八 燕邸清明","author":"曹尔堪","text":"宫柳迎风剪绿齐，隗台春压杏花低。\n谁家小袜印香泥。\n玉勒连钱盘辇路，毳裘油壁驻金堤，旧陵芳草杜鹃啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36057,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其九 感秋","author":"曹尔堪","text":"雪急清砧紧树红，昼垂银蒜雨濛濛。\n洞箫吹倚画楼空。\n丹凤城高乌叫月，白龙堆冷马嘶风。\n边愁都在暮笳中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36058,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其十 邯郸道中","author":"曹尔堪","text":"赵国寒烟绕鹿车，晓星晴挂柳梢斜。\n丛台何处问繁华。\n公子毬场争蹴鞠，佳人绣阁斗琵琶。\n祗余秋草没黄沙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36059,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其十一 晚秋漫兴","author":"曹尔堪","text":"晓露生妍黑丑花，乱虫鸣轧木棉斜。\n棠梨霜叶赤如砂。\n真似客归遗燕垒，尽容人占是鸥沙。\n柴门中有故侯家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36060,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮  有赠","author":"曹尔堪","text":"夜阑香汗罗衫薄，凉生枕簟人儿觉。\n欲去且迟迟，流连三伏时。\n妾家何处住，白庙西原路。\n乡漫说温柔，此乡应可游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36061,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子  忆梦","author":"曹尔堪","text":"愁剧暂成眠，有梦轻如絮。\n醒后犹期会面难，何况天涯路。\n相见不禁欢，醒却无寻处。\n但愿年年在梦中，一世和郎住。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36062,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丑奴儿令  其一 晓妆","author":"曹尔堪","text":"晓风吹破流苏暖，花满香奁。\n蝶满湘帘。\n拾起残红玉笋尖。\n未梳蝉鬓如云压，膏沐微沾。\n宫粉轻拈。\n十样新眉懒去添。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36063,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丑奴儿令 其二 闺思","author":"曹尔堪","text":"远山染黛帘初卷，新月微笼，薄雾轻笼。\n只许巫山入梦中。\n晓妆惆怅无人见，杏样衫好，茜样鞋红。\n半臂殷勤护守宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36064,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丑奴儿令 其三 惜别","author":"曹尔堪","text":"多情一向真痴绝，范蠡湖边，西子湖边。\n两地相逢再世缘。\n别时杯酒浇何处，夜合花前，芍药花前。\n独自悲欢若个怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36065,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花  其一 夏日杂咏","author":"曹尔堪","text":"幽兰欲吐，移进阑干看愈妩。\n散发当风，上有千寻绿荫浓。\n纳凉池阁，林影波中鱼戏乐。\n芳饵刚垂，一尺黄鱼上钓丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36066,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其二 初夏放舟郭外","author":"曹尔堪","text":"垂垂紫楝，四月江心频点燕。\n亭馆谁家，天棘抽条出屋斜。\n轻舠不稳，移向伍塘风力紧。\n晴日将西，黄犊江村水一犁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36067,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减字木兰花 其三 春暮","author":"曹尔堪","text":"晚飘红雨，吹乱蔷薇啼杜宇。\n绿树新阴，中有青楼惜别心。\n湘帘半落，细听呢喃催绣箔。\n心事谁传，传语鹦哥当锦笺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36068,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒金门  写别","author":"曹尔堪","text":"多情种，别后泪痕潮涌。\n绮户海棠春雨重。\n芳心愁自捧。\n花也和人争宠，肠断锦衾孤拥。\n小字红笺谁与送，相思看笔冢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36069,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"好事近  其一 送客北游","author":"曹尔堪","text":"斯世少英雄，应笑成名竖子。\n衰草夕阳弥望，吊金元遗垒。\n霜桥孤月照空囊，枯树乱鸦起，旅馆芜菁低照，读数行残史。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36070,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"好事近 其二 夷门书屋","author":"曹尔堪","text":"舴艋泛溪花，流水一湾堪泊。\n古木撑云溜雨，似垂髯猿猱。\n山中日尽已忘年，展卷代行乐。\n短簿祠前归去，见紫薇花落。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36071,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥   其一 戏和","author":"曹尔堪","text":"垂珠幕，罗裙怕引狂风恶。\n狂风恶。\n画楼深处，是谁轻薄。\n帐儿偎倚星儿落。\n莫惊犬吠金铃索。\n金铃索。\n饶他夜静，有人知觉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36072,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 其二 冬感","author":"曹尔堪","text":"残霞没。\n隃糜冻黑西风突。\n西风突。\n怪鸱悲啸，一天霜月。\n衔杯慷慨冠冲发。\n古今人物都消歇。\n都消歇。\n阴房鬼火，战场枯骨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36073,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 其三 伤逝","author":"曹尔堪","text":"东君恶。\n好花未足风先落。\n风先落。\n啼猿两岸，峡云飘泊。\n问天搔首天疑错。\n无端玉树尘埋却。\n尘埋却。\n诸公皆在，斯人不作。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36074,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐  其一 闺词","author":"曹尔堪","text":"眉痕频皱。\n不似东风旧。\n欺尽孤眠寒更透。\n生得腰肢元瘦。\n梨花静掩长门。\n寻常过几黄昏。\n魂向当初销尽，如何又说销魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36075,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐 其二 隔船却寄为澹心赋和韵","author":"曹尔堪","text":"轻衫雪皎，稳称身材小。\n隔水秋波频送巧，勾引相思难了。\n柳枝插入杨枝，故人青眼修眉。\n对面盈盈不语，浑疑暗忆当时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36076,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐 其三 答澹心","author":"曹尔堪","text":"故人何处，居傍要离墓。\n滕六剪花浓似絮。\n练鹊巧穿林去。\n翩翩鹤氅羊裘。\n羡伊才子风流。\n试种疏梅绕屋，暮年端傲封侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36077,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甘草子  春情","author":"曹尔堪","text":"春暮。\n晓雾空濛，认作丝丝雨。\n侍女醒扶头，钗坠惊鹦鹉。\n百尺游丝轻举。\n空罥住、梨花难吐，唤起朝朝枕边语，恨多情如许。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36078,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阮郎归 寒村漫兴","author":"曹尔堪","text":"涧流传响聚沙红，海云城角浓。\n征途肃肃绕寒风。\n霜花催晓鸿。\n枌树底，荻花东。\n远村诗画中。\n虎头老手辋川翁，知他同不同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36079,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"锦堂春  清凉寺扫叶上人山楼","author":"曹尔堪","text":"如练澄江东泻，舂锄舞雪蒙茸。\n倚楼遥见迎潮燕，飞趁片帆风。\n楚蜀烟波不断，齐梁佳丽都空。\n山僧不识兴亡感，闲数落花红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36080,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"朝中措  其一 龙潭驿怀旧","author":"曹尔堪","text":"惊涛吹簸老龙憨，暮雨且停骖。\n红树斜分建业，青山多在江南。\n远樯排汉，乱帆击汰，百尺空潭。\n一曲渭城歌罢，酒楼谁是何戡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36081,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"朝中措 其二 东干小憩","author":"曹尔堪","text":"平沙水漫暮潮通，亚竹野桃红。\n燕子国中佳日，白鸥社里东风。\n干将故里，避喧铲迹，斗酒过从。\n错字休教铁铸，来寻三泖渔翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36082,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山花子 秋晚","author":"曹尔堪","text":"黄蝶寻花褪薄衣，槐阴吹老漏斜晖。\n红枣挂枝秋已熟，打应稀。\n不断雁声和月叫，重惊鸦宿带霜飞。\n田有香粳园有菊，几时归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36083,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳梢青  春闺","author":"曹尔堪","text":"昨日清明。\n桃花红浪，做出多情。\n带恨黏愁，无端若住、一点春饧。\n东风难雨难晴，看又过、残花乱莺。\n酒伴关心，灯前偷泪，撩乱银筝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36084,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西江月 其一 题玄真子浮家泛宅图韵","author":"曹尔堪","text":"有客渔焉终老，惟君赐者家。\n钓竿茶龟隔船纱，携去随潮上下。\n水口红桃流散，山前白鹭飞斜。\n风波恶处舞神鸦，笑卷青蓑归罢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36085,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西江月 其二 归真","author":"曹尔堪","text":"一枕微侵云鬓，三更方卸鞋弓。\n解衣瞥见舞裙红，何事挑灯相送。\n会逐晓云俱散，魂随春絮常通。\n鸳鸯睡醒画楼空，枉做人间痴梦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36086,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西江月 其三 和壁间韵","author":"曹尔堪","text":"白日难教东下，清淮肯使西流。\n春风吹罢又惊秋，早叹朱颜非旧。\n乌巷家家王谢，黄初字字徐刘。\n荒榛鬼火北邙头，谁是诸公之后。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36087,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西江月 其四 景阳楼","author":"曹尔堪","text":"丝管竞调玉树，氍毹暗坠金钿。\n酒酣狎客劈红笺，受用佳人捧砚。\n尽道无愁天子，还疑有劫神仙。\n景阳钟罢最堪怜，井上胭脂零乱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36088,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西江月 其五 隋苑","author":"曹尔堪","text":"别殿珠帘夜月，长堤御柳春风。\n繁华三十六离宫，钿合同心谁送。\n龙舸方游汴水，狼烟旋报京东。\n锦衾才与梦儿同，转眼迷楼是梦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36089,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西江月 其六 咏怀","author":"曹尔堪","text":"橐笔久陪南苑，含香近侍西清。\n春风淡沲梦江城，贺监湖光似镜。\n白发衰年易过，黄金大药难成。\n病坊早已属先生，谁道文园渴更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36090,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"少年游  柬友","author":"曹尔堪","text":"故园春到弄芳菲，人静落红稀。\n柳岸渔汀，风来水面，鸂鶒一双飞。\n泖东丙舍宵闻鹤，潇洒芰荷衣。\n鲈脍烘盐，莼羹杂豉，何负季鹰归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36091,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉花阴  春景","author":"曹尔堪","text":"烘桃熨柳春方纵，红雨花梢重。\n风日近清明，几片榆钱，都算莺儿俸。\n冷烟堆径和谁共，苔补闲阶空。\n杜宇莫频啼，不唤人归，只唤三更梦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36092,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南歌子  西湖夜泛","author":"曹尔堪","text":"镜展娇如雪，衫轻怯受风。\n薄阴偏觉鬓丝浓。\n独喜清秋无暑、画船空。\n频劝杯中绿，微添酒后红。\n银筝一曲手玲珑。\n见有檀痕低掐、印酥胸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36093,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"双调望江南   秋暮","author":"曹尔堪","text":"秋欲暮，江水尽生凉。\n鸥浴似添涛外雪，林疏微映菊前黄。\n材屋日恒长。\n初刈获、粳秫半登场。\n簖起肥螯宜买醉，瓮倾新酒远闻香。\n一笑举杯觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36094,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙  其一 戊寅十二月二日过智月禅院时冬燠红梅盛开","author":"曹尔堪","text":"唤渡近衡门，信步南村。\n薄绵今日觉微温。\n梅染胭脂先破腊。\n伴佛黄昏。\n冷淡许谁论，菜甲篁孙。\n逢僧闲话半无根。\n斜日一帘当户卷，曝取朝暾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36095,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 其二 上巳","author":"曹尔堪","text":"送暖晓来风，春信微通。\n满城芳草暮愁中。\n寒食才过宫柳暗，烟树朦胧。\n杜曲踏芳丛，有个人同。\n盘龙绣领御沟东。\n日落河桥归路晚，嘶断花骢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36096,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙 其三 甲辰寒夜遇同馆周文夏侍御于虎丘步月","author":"曹尔堪","text":"松影绕回塘，小阁焚香。\n可中亭外月如霜。\n剑气浑疑冲静夜，一片寒光。\n落叶打虚廊，僧梦方长。\n排空叫雁也成行。\n容我五湖随范蠡，烟雨鸣榔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":36097,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]